  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中國與地緣政治",
    "sub_ename": "CHINA AND GEOPOLITICS",
    "describe_ch": "近年來中國以「一帶一路」及調整與美、俄等大國外交之政策，影響國際地緣政治的格局發展。地緣政治學亦因頻繁發生的地緣衝突成為國際的熱門議題，例如俄烏戰爭、以哈衝突、韓半島危機等，惟多數人對其仍欠缺了解。本課程希望藉由四大單元主題的授課內容、案例分析、課堂心得作業及分組討論等方式，帶領同學認識地緣政治學及中國的地緣政治格局、地緣戰略、與大國的海陸競逐等議題，提升學生的國際視野及思辨能力。",
    "describe_eh": "In recent years, China has influenced the development of the international geopolitical landscape by the One Belt, One Road initiative and adjustments to its diplomatic relations with great powers such as the United States and Russia. Geopolitics has also become an international hot topic due to frequent geopolitical conflicts, such as the Russia-Ukraine war, the Israel-Hamas conflict, the Korean Peninsula crisis, etc. However, most people are still lacking the understanding of geopolitics. This course hopes to lead students to understand geopolitics and China's geopolitical patterns, geostrategy, and competitions between great powers on land and sea. Additionally, the course can enhance students’ international vision and critical thinking ability through the teaching methods of lecturing the content of the four major themes, case studies, classroom homework, and discussions of groups.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
